      <cyrillic>зантай</cyrillic>
      <transcript>ZANGTAI</transcript>
      <definition>adj. Having a certain habit or character; having a temper.</definition>
      <page>1036</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠠᠩᠲᠠᠢ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
