        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠣᠯᠠᠨ ᠵᠠᠩᠲᠠᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>olan -- </transcript>
          <definition> Moody, emotional.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠠᠶᠢᠨ ᠵᠠᠩᠲᠠᠢ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
